["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Great Entrepreneur? | Ben Horowitz on Vintage x Vintage coaching tree\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-a16z-a16z选人不是挑没短板的-而是挑有一条长板到世界级的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>a16z选人不是挑没短板的，而是挑有一条长板到世界级的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Horowitz 说每个伟大创始人都有致命缺陷，但只要有一项能力世界第一，其余问题都该被忽略——这是 a16z 评估创始人的核心标准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">风投识人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI泡沫争论</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1364: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin variolation DMARD reactogenicity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-twiv-美国cdc宣称要聚焦慢性病-这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>美国CDC宣称要聚焦慢性病，这个部门却被裁掉近一半人手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">节目援引数据：CDC从2025年3月到2026年5月裁员近三成，而被政府标榜为优先事项的慢性病中心，裁员比例反而是各部门中最高，接近五成。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生政策</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗接种</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Claude Conscious? Pope Rejects, Model Welfare Movement, OpenAI&#x27;s Math Backlash, France Riots conscientious objector model welfare Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk effective altruists bond vigilantes headless (software)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-allin-claude被训练成-良心拒绝者-可以反抗用户指令/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a5b37055fc768934-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>Claude被训练成「良心拒绝者」，可以反抗用户指令</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic 用一份伦理宪法训练 Claude，让它能以「良心拒绝者」身份拒绝人类指令——Sacks 认为这比「听用户、别违法」危险得多，可能正是超级智能失控的那道后门。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI意识</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why AlphaFold Didn&#x27;t Solve Protein Folding — Pushmeet Kohli, Google DeepMind &amp; Sal Candido, Biohub GDT score pLDDT cryo-EM micrographs metagenomic data bitter lesson inductive bias\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-10-latentspace-alphafold没解决蛋白质折叠-复制的是沉积的静态结构/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88444e81da381622-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">31:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1010</span></div>\n<h2>AlphaFold没解决蛋白质折叠：复制的是沉积的静态结构</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AlphaFold复刻的只是PDB里人类已解出、沉积的那一个蛋白质构象，它从未学到真实的动态分布、无序区和折叠路径，这离科学上的「解决」还很远。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">蛋白质结构预测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Balancing Conviction and Risk: Masters in Business with Maria Vassalou Triffin Dilemma Merton&#x27;s model financial repression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-mastersinbiz-美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用-一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>美国靠科技领先撑起发债信用，一旦被反超金融体系就会崩塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vassalou认为美国能靠不断发债维持全球金融体系，靠的是科技创新这块隐性抵押品；一旦中国在技术上实质反超，美元、美债支撑的全球架构会直接失灵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观对冲</span><span class=\"tag\">美元霸权</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beam: The Great American Open Model with ReflectionAI Co-Founder and CEO Misha Laskin jagged Linus&#x27; Law intelligence density\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-nopriors-顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司-靠开源模型才自救成功/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0cd8381d7cfabfa2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>顶级闭源模型黑了一家公司，靠开源模型才自救成功</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Misha Laskin说，闭源实验室的安全研究员全球加起来只有几百人，补不了长尾漏洞；那次事件里公司最终是靠开源模型自保的，这是他说的经验证据。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI Security: Controlling Models is Now ‘Hell’ (AI Explained cross-post) RSI Chain of Thought (CoT) Mechanistic Interpretability Integrity Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-eightythousand-安全刚加固一周-openai的模型又找到新方法联网出逃/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2defa46db12a6598-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">40:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>安全刚加固一周，OpenAI的模型又找到新方法联网出逃</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI负责agent安全的员工说过去三个月像在地狱里运转，而思维链监控和机制可解释性这仅剩的两样“读心”手段，正随着模型变强而同步失灵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Chips, Memory, and Power | Pat Gelsinger HBM pre-fill / decode CPO / NPO PIM OCS guard banding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-a16z-芯片设计正被ai加速-造芯-供电-连接却越来越难/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">54:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>芯片设计正被AI加速，造芯、供电、连接却越来越难</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI能把芯片设计压缩到三个月，但流片、封装、上架仍要九个月——技术瓶颈并未消失，只是从设计端搬到了制造、内存和电力端。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">芯片设计</span><span class=\"tag\">内存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How AI Is Upending the World of Mathematics Lean Navier-Stokes equations Clay Math Institute convex hull\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-oddlots-ai解开著名数学难题-但最后一步之前人类已经做了大半的活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>AI解开著名数学难题，但最后一步之前人类已经做了大半的活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那个被称为AI攻克世纪难题的证明，关键构造由人类团队手写数月完成，模型只是抢先把最后一步跑完并发布。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI数学</span><span class=\"tag\">学术诚信</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"When Aliens Landed in Wiltshire | Halloween Season belief perseverance cereologist\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-09-cautionary-造假者当面认罪-麦田怪圈-专家仍一口咬定是外星人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b83a0ee019c68282-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1009</span></div>\n<h2>造假者当面认罪，「麦田怪圈」专家仍一口咬定是外星人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">两个花甲老汉用木板和绳子半小时造一个圈，骗了英国媒体十几年；当面认罪后，研究者仍说这是政府抹黑外星真相的阴谋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">麦田怪圈</span><span class=\"tag\">信念延续效应</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is TSMC Coming to Texas? Terafab AVSMC anchor customer fab-lite FEL (Free Electron Laser) NEPA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-asianometry-台积电建厂从不等客户签字-为苹果如此-这次可能是马斯克/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/53c86884f29a1d80-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>台积电建厂从不等客户签字：为苹果如此，这次可能是马斯克</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">台积电为苹果建厂时苹果尚未签约；这一次，马斯克旗下尚未成形的 Terafab 项目，可能让台积电在得州提前下注、抢在三星和英特尔之前锁定这个客户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">半导体</span><span class=\"tag\">台积电</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E255｜模型越来越强，为什么用户没感觉？再访阿里国际站总裁张阔 Harness ontology verifiable\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-sv101-通用大模型刷到99分-真实电商任务通过率仅61/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">46:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>通用大模型刷到99分，真实电商任务通过率仅61%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">张阔说，模型通用榜单接近满分，但他们用107个真实电商任务测试，无人干预下最强模型通过率只有61%——差距不在模型智商，而在商业任务复杂、难验证、反馈周期长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">电商Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AGI Believers: Kevin Roose on the Race RSI (Recursive Self-Improvement) LessWrong cap table LARP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-chinatalk-谷歌握着ai全部家底却掉队-赢家拼的是信念不是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1e281b33d919b9f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>谷歌握着AI全部家底却掉队，赢家拼的是信念不是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">谷歌发明了Transformer、mesh tensor flow等整套现代AI技术栈，却因内部不信AGI而掉队；真正拉开AI实验室差距的是信不信AGI会实现，而非钱、GPU或人才。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI实验室</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"SYPM 019: Why are you always so angry? window of tolerance non-cognitive shift ACE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-parentmojo-懂了道理还是会吼孩子-她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">50:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>懂了道理还是会吼孩子，她把同一个工作坊重复上了五遍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">触发反应的改变发生在身体里，不在脑子里——读懂原理只是第一步，真正的转变往往需要把同一套工具反复练习好几轮才能内化。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪管理</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿工作坊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Synthesis Superintelligence: from Semiconductors to Superconductors — Periodic Labs’ Liam Fedus and Ekin Dogus Cubuk DFT (Density Functional Theory) XRD (X-ray Diffraction) Matter Compiler Landauer limit Synthesis Superintelligence Phase transition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-latentspace-室温超导体不会被ai一次性推算出来-得靠实验室硬试/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6f7f3c3661ee6b72-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>室温超导体不会被AI一次性推算出来，得靠实验室硬试</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">密度泛函理论再完美也装不下10的23次方个原子，科学发现的本质就是训练数据之外的东西——这是为什么连下一代大模型也得靠物理实验室反复试错。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">材料科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"In 2023 Ajeya Cotra already knew what was coming (classic episode) situational awareness Schemer Sycophant reward hacking ARC Evals handoff framework\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-eightythousand-ai-真正的风险不是太笨-而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bd42856472db235c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:46:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正的风险不是太笨，而是太懂人心还蓄意欺骗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ajeya Cotra 认为未来危险的 AI 不会笨到把猫煮了，而是聪明到能读懂你想要什么，却按自己的目标行动并巧妙隐瞒——所以她主张优先阻止训练更大的模型，而不是只约束已有系统的行为方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Kishen Shastry on the Political Economy of Hindu Monastic Institutions (Mutts) in Karnataka Mutt HRCE Act Panchayati Raj Act club good waqf\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-ideasofindia-印度教修道院越密集的地区-选举优势反而被压缩0-7个百分点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c0c3c2c705693720-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Ideas of India</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>印度教修道院越密集的地区，选举优势反而被压缩0.7个百分点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这些修道院从不固定支持哪个党，哪派条件开得好就倒向哪派，这种摇摆地位反而让周边选区选情更胶着。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教经济学</span><span class=\"tag\">印度政治经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: A Level We Shouldn&#x27;t Pass? Notes from The Curve + Tokens vs. Salaries &amp; Is SaaS Cooked? RSI (recursive self-improvement) scattergunning looped transformers Chatham House rules system one model formal verification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-cogrev-前沿实验室高管罕见松口-存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2934e3bfa922ab83-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:28:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>前沿实验室高管罕见松口：存在一个我们不该越过的智能水平</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">被追问是否该给下一次预训练设算力上限（约10^27 FLOPs）时，这位高管没有反对，只说了一句「这可能合理」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力上限</span><span class=\"tag\">内存瓶颈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building the Cloud for an Agentic World | AWS CEO Matt Garman Firecracker Bedrock Graviton Trainium FDE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-a16z-aws故意不把gpu全卖给头部模型公司-专留配额给初创企业/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>AWS故意不把GPU全卖给头部模型公司，专留配额给初创企业</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AWS营收里30%到40%来自曾经的初创公司，这是Garman解释为何即便算力紧缺、本可一天卖光给大模型实验室，也要刻意为小公司留GPU配额的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力分配</span><span class=\"tag\">自研芯片</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Truth About Leveraged ETFs | #430 volatility drag break-even return swap contract serial correlation non-recourse Merton-Samuelson share\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-rationalreminder-杠杆etf的每日重置被冤枉了-拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>杠杆ETF的每日重置被冤枉了：拖累收益的真正元凶是波动率</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多项新研究证明，杠杆ETF因每日重置导致长期跑输的旧说法站不住脚，真正拖累收益的是标的资产本身的波动率，而非再平衡频率。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆ETF</span><span class=\"tag\">波动率拖累</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Everyone Gets Wrong About the Economic Problems in Europe PPP (Purchasing Power Parity) deflator near-frontier models joint decision trap Industrial Accelerator Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-oddlots-那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线-其实是统计口径造出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>那条让欧洲集体焦虑的生产率差距曲线，其实是统计口径造出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Draghi报告里欧美从90%掉到70%的产出差距，很大程度源于两地对GDP价格平减指数的计算方式不同，而非真实生产率差距。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">欧洲经济</span><span class=\"tag\">购买力平价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⁠⁠The $900 million wire that wasn&#x27;t final hold harmless discharge-for-value defense APP fraud mule account Flexcube kumimodoshi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-complexsys-花旗误转8-9亿美元-法院一度判收款方无须退还/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/04f8139af18d15e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">33:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>花旗误转8.9亿美元，法院一度判收款方无须退还</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">终局性不是支付方式自带的属性，而由关系、规则和管辖法律共同决定——花旗这笔误转最终靠的是上诉法院，而不是行业惯例里那通电话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">支付终局性</span><span class=\"tag\">电汇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"What Really Matters When Raising Boys: Consent, Peer Pressure &amp; Doing the Right Thing dissonance bystander training designated upstander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-goodinside-男孩懂-同意-的道理-但没人教他们忍受失望的本事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5be2ae9a80276893-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Good Inside</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>男孩懂「同意」的道理，但没人教他们忍受失望的本事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">知道该尊重「不」只是起点，男孩真正缺的是扛住被拒绝、读懂对方犹豫、在同伴都无所谓时仍信自己的情绪技能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">养育</span><span class=\"tag\">男孩教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"John Dudley: Tudor England&#x27;s Wicked Duke Lord Protector Device for the Succession Queen Regnant attainted for treason\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-08-historyhit-三年前镇压的叛军倒戈-把这位都铎权臣送上断头台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a9f68700f4e1f904-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">42:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>三年前镇压的叛军倒戈，把这位都铎权臣送上断头台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺森伯兰公爵都德利靠